    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math> be any function defined on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> and let it satisfy the condition:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>. If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then :"
